WEBVTT

00:00.751 --> 00:02.628
Once we get past this floor,

00:02.711 --> 00:05.297
all that's left is the hall
where the dungeon core is located.

00:07.966 --> 00:09.635
The guardian of the ninth floor.

00:10.385 --> 00:13.138
Fire everything at once!

00:23.815 --> 00:25.317
I knew it.

00:25.692 --> 00:28.487
I've missed you, you skeleton bastard.

00:30.239 --> 00:32.074
I'm going to pay you back

00:32.449 --> 00:33.575
for what you did to me in the sky.

00:37.704 --> 00:39.456
Mage Warrior's unique skill,

00:39.790 --> 00:41.625
Mana Convergence!

00:42.793 --> 00:44.753
Mana Boost!

00:45.963 --> 00:47.673
Elemental Sword. Wind.

00:48.966 --> 00:49.967
Sword Master Arts.

00:50.467 --> 00:53.762
Impact Slash!

00:59.017 --> 01:01.979
This attack leaves me wide open.

01:02.062 --> 01:03.981
I have to time it carefully.

01:04.064 --> 01:05.440
Teacher.

01:08.151 --> 01:08.986
What?

01:09.444 --> 01:11.405
No. Absolutely not.

01:16.368 --> 01:17.786
We have to win.

01:17.870 --> 01:18.954
Right.

01:20.950 --> 01:21.790
(Legendary Skeleton Dark Knight
Race: Magic Beast, Undead)

01:21.870 --> 01:22.700
(Status: Guardian, Undead, Level 24)

01:22.790 --> 01:24.410
(Special Skill: Potential Release)
It took a magical attack that powerful,

01:24.500 --> 01:25.910
(Title: Dungeon Guardian)
yet it's almost unscathed.

01:34.720 --> 01:36.847
Urushi, take care of the horse.

01:37.890 --> 01:38.807
Let's do it!

02:01.038 --> 02:02.748
(Reincarnated as a Sword Season 2)

03:22.828 --> 03:23.662
Good.

03:29.501 --> 03:31.587
It's so heavy.

03:38.802 --> 03:40.304
That bastard.

03:40.387 --> 03:41.805
Fran, are you okay?

03:41.889 --> 03:42.931
I'm fine.

03:43.849 --> 03:46.685
Based on the stats alone,
the enemy is clearly superior.

03:47.269 --> 03:50.063
Even with magic and skills boosting her,

03:50.147 --> 03:52.232
and with Teacher's support,

03:52.316 --> 03:53.483
she's barely holding her own.

04:07.873 --> 04:09.833
Urushi is struggling a bit too.

04:15.881 --> 04:17.591
What? The armor is...

04:17.674 --> 04:18.842
(Episode 3: The Undead Are Resilient)

04:18.926 --> 04:20.886
Is this the power of a Dungeon Guardian?

04:21.303 --> 04:23.430
The Undead don't feel pain.

04:23.514 --> 04:26.642
They regenerate from minor damage
and never get tired.

04:50.499 --> 04:51.333
Fran!

04:51.416 --> 04:52.543
It's not over yet!

04:54.545 --> 04:55.420
Let's do it.

04:55.921 --> 04:58.382
A long fight is bad for us, Teacher.

04:59.800 --> 05:02.094
Skill. Mana Detection.

05:04.137 --> 05:05.889
He's interfering with my detection?

05:05.973 --> 05:06.807
Damn it.

05:06.890 --> 05:09.601
It'll be hard to aim for the mana stone
and turn the tables all at once.

05:09.685 --> 05:10.811
What should I do?

05:11.603 --> 05:15.357
I'll look for an opening while I fight.

05:15.440 --> 05:17.150
That's all we can do.

05:29.997 --> 05:31.164
It grazed me.

05:31.248 --> 05:33.208
It has a low chance
of triggering instant death.

05:33.959 --> 05:35.878
Even if it's not a 100 percent chance,

05:35.961 --> 05:38.463
it would've been dangerous
without the Black Cat gear.

05:38.964 --> 05:40.465
We have Garrus to thank for that.

05:40.549 --> 05:41.550
Yes.

05:44.720 --> 05:47.264
Press the attack!

05:53.645 --> 05:55.522
Auto Mana Strike.

05:55.606 --> 05:57.191
He even has a move like that?

06:00.360 --> 06:02.154
Leave the healing to me.

06:02.237 --> 06:03.864
Jean, thank you.

06:13.248 --> 06:14.124
Fran.

06:14.208 --> 06:16.502
It doesn't hurt, but it's troublesome.

06:17.044 --> 06:18.253
In that case...

06:23.050 --> 06:23.967
What?

06:24.468 --> 06:28.096
Skill. Mana Barrier has reached level 10.

06:28.972 --> 06:30.724
I used my self-evolution points

06:30.807 --> 06:33.143
to raise Mana Barrier to the max level.

06:33.227 --> 06:34.728
As expected of you, Teacher.

06:34.811 --> 06:36.230
Now I can go all out.

06:42.986 --> 06:43.820
What?

06:49.243 --> 06:52.329
Thunder Magic, Paralyzing Electric Blast!

06:57.501 --> 06:58.919
Paralysis didn't work.

06:59.837 --> 07:01.880
This is only going to get harder.

07:06.051 --> 07:08.679
Quick, find its weakness.

07:19.189 --> 07:20.107
This fellow...

07:21.567 --> 07:23.026
Fran, did you notice?

07:23.735 --> 07:25.279
It's protecting its head.

07:25.696 --> 07:27.531
The mana stone is likely in its head.

07:27.990 --> 07:30.033
But its defense is solid.

07:34.079 --> 07:34.955
Urushi!

07:37.040 --> 07:37.916
How about it, Fran?

07:38.000 --> 07:39.293
Understood!

07:42.796 --> 07:44.339
Now! Switch!

07:45.966 --> 07:47.009
Nice!

07:49.970 --> 07:51.013
They switched.

07:51.096 --> 07:53.265
The skeletal horse's mana stone
is in its neck.

07:53.348 --> 07:54.308
Got it.

07:54.391 --> 07:56.852
Dragon Fang!

08:08.405 --> 08:09.948
Mana Stone Absorption!

08:16.872 --> 08:18.498
High Undead

08:18.790 --> 08:20.792
possess something similar to emotions.

08:20.959 --> 08:22.961
It's a gamble, but...

08:23.295 --> 08:24.254
Fran!

08:24.338 --> 08:26.298
Sonic Jet!

08:26.381 --> 08:29.301
And Mental Catapult!

08:30.552 --> 08:32.763
Become Fran's experience points!

08:41.146 --> 08:42.105
What?

08:42.648 --> 08:44.441
What's happening?

08:54.993 --> 08:55.911
Fran!

08:57.538 --> 08:59.248
Teacher, this fellow...

08:59.748 --> 09:02.835
His sword pressure is insane.

09:07.506 --> 09:10.175
What did he do?

09:10.801 --> 09:12.010
Appraisal.

09:13.840 --> 09:15.130
(Status: Guardian)
Potential...

09:15.220 --> 09:17.140
(Potential Release)
Release?

09:17.724 --> 09:20.811
It forcibly releases
the user's latent potential.

09:20.894 --> 09:23.397
It's a temporary power boost,

09:23.856 --> 09:26.984
but life force continuously drains
while it's active.

09:27.067 --> 09:30.237
And the user must pay a specific price.

09:30.988 --> 09:34.491
His strength and agility
are both over 1,000.

09:50.340 --> 09:51.550
Fran!

09:54.511 --> 09:55.888
Greater Heal!

09:57.431 --> 09:58.473
Can you move?

09:59.057 --> 10:00.434
It's all fixed.

10:00.517 --> 10:01.602
Where's Urushi?

10:02.060 --> 10:03.270
Are you okay over there?

10:06.523 --> 10:07.482
He's coming.

10:14.406 --> 10:15.282
This is bad.

10:15.365 --> 10:16.909
Fran, get some distance.

10:22.998 --> 10:24.291
Perish.

10:25.501 --> 10:26.502
- Jean.
- Jean.

10:29.630 --> 10:33.091
Underworld Magic, Reverse Undead!

10:43.185 --> 10:44.186
Just as I thought.

10:45.020 --> 10:47.814
A spell meant to destroy High Undead

10:48.190 --> 10:49.566
didn't have any effect at all.

11:03.247 --> 11:04.122
Fran!

11:06.667 --> 11:07.835
Damn it!

11:13.298 --> 11:14.716
Greater Heal!

11:32.734 --> 11:34.778
Victory is suddenly out of reach.

11:35.153 --> 11:37.656
So this is Potential Release.

11:38.657 --> 11:40.534
Fran, steal that skill!

11:41.368 --> 11:42.369
Come on.

11:43.996 --> 11:44.913
Urushi.

11:47.124 --> 11:48.625
Skill Taker!

11:52.379 --> 11:53.589
Great.

11:57.467 --> 11:58.302
Wait.

11:59.720 --> 12:02.681
Failed to steal Potential Release.

12:02.764 --> 12:04.892
What? It's not a guaranteed success?

12:05.684 --> 12:08.687
That skill is an extra skill
of the same rank.

12:08.770 --> 12:10.272
Therefore, it's ineffective.

12:11.732 --> 12:16.612
Currently, I can only steal skills
ranked lower than extra skills.

12:17.404 --> 12:19.406
No way. Damn it.

12:28.790 --> 12:29.833
Fran!

12:29.917 --> 12:33.170
I'm fine. I can still keep going.

12:33.545 --> 12:35.964
At this rate, Fran won't hold out.

12:36.048 --> 12:37.966
Damn it. What should I do?

12:38.133 --> 12:39.134
Is there any way?

12:39.843 --> 12:42.137
Use Mental Catapult again?

12:42.554 --> 12:45.140
No, against an opponent that fast...

12:45.807 --> 12:49.645
Teacher, level up Sword Master Arts.

12:51.146 --> 12:53.732
We can't win like this.

12:54.066 --> 12:55.359
Fran...

12:56.818 --> 12:57.903
I got it.

12:59.738 --> 13:01.823
Sword Master Arts has reached level 5.

13:02.449 --> 13:04.076
Fran, I'm sorry.

13:04.535 --> 13:07.120
I've become too overconfident.

13:07.454 --> 13:09.540
We're partners after all.

13:10.666 --> 13:11.500
No.

13:14.169 --> 13:17.214
Teacher and I are the strongest partners.

13:25.848 --> 13:27.349
My body feels so light.

13:27.850 --> 13:30.143
My movements are being optimized.

13:30.769 --> 13:34.398
And power keeps surging
now that Fran is using me.

13:34.481 --> 13:36.316
What's this feeling?

13:36.692 --> 13:38.068
You're amazing, Fran.

13:38.443 --> 13:41.113
Teacher, I think we can do it now.

13:42.573 --> 13:45.075
Our special move!

13:45.492 --> 13:46.827
You mean...

13:48.453 --> 13:52.249
This move leaves a huge opening
after swinging.

13:52.332 --> 13:54.293
We need to be careful with the timing.

13:54.376 --> 13:58.046
Teacher, I've thought of our special move.

13:59.298 --> 14:01.300
And then like this.

14:01.592 --> 14:05.762
No, that's too much of a burden on you.

14:09.266 --> 14:10.601
That move?

14:11.810 --> 14:13.896
If we don't use it, we can't win.

14:14.313 --> 14:16.398
But your body...

14:16.982 --> 14:18.859
It's okay. Let me do it.

14:20.485 --> 14:21.570
I see.

14:21.904 --> 14:23.113
All right. Let's do it.

14:23.447 --> 14:25.032
Thank you, Teacher.

14:25.574 --> 14:26.992
Mana Convergence!

14:28.410 --> 14:30.954
Go. Mana Boost!

14:32.456 --> 14:34.374
Elemental Sword. Wind!

14:34.917 --> 14:35.918
Take this!

14:37.085 --> 14:38.420
Sword Master Arts.

14:38.504 --> 14:41.590
Impact Slash!

14:46.053 --> 14:47.179
Now!

14:47.262 --> 14:51.600
Use Telekinesis to force
the swing of Impact Slash to stop!

14:53.143 --> 14:54.937
Then use Telekinesis again!

14:58.357 --> 15:02.110
Heavy Slash!

15:04.905 --> 15:05.948
What? It's dodging.

15:09.159 --> 15:11.203
I won't let you dodge!

15:11.286 --> 15:13.622
Extend! Shape-Shift!

15:28.220 --> 15:29.096
Fran!

15:34.768 --> 15:36.728
That debt from the sky...

15:36.812 --> 15:38.313
I've paid it back.

15:44.319 --> 15:46.280
How are you? Does it still hurt?

15:46.655 --> 15:47.948
I'm fine now.

15:48.907 --> 15:51.827
Teacher, I've perfected our special move.

15:51.910 --> 15:53.412
Fran...

15:54.246 --> 15:57.791
I know that keeping someone safe
and being too protective are different.

16:00.210 --> 16:03.547
At this rate, she's going to become
a total battle maniac.

16:05.090 --> 16:06.383
Let's fight.

16:06.758 --> 16:07.968
That was a brilliant fight.

16:10.137 --> 16:12.347
It's all thanks to Jean and Urushi's help.

16:12.639 --> 16:13.640
Thank you.

16:14.057 --> 16:15.392
It was a tough battle,

16:15.475 --> 16:18.020
but I gained 300 mana points
and Interference Detection,

16:18.103 --> 16:20.939
as well as Auto Mana Strike
and other useful skills.

16:21.023 --> 16:24.693
I also got the extra skill, Potential Release.

16:25.194 --> 16:26.486
While it's an incredibly powerful skill,

16:26.570 --> 16:29.072
it comes with a unique price.

16:29.156 --> 16:29.990
It continuously drains

16:30.073 --> 16:31.742
(Guardian, Potential Release)
your life force.

16:32.784 --> 16:34.828
I can't exactly test it out easily.

16:37.247 --> 16:38.832
The same goes for that spearman earlier.

16:38.916 --> 16:40.709
Are you taking those with you too?

16:41.043 --> 16:45.756
They are extremely valuable
as catalysts for necromancy.

16:47.341 --> 16:49.384
What am I going to do with them?

16:49.468 --> 16:50.969
I can't wait to find out.

16:51.053 --> 16:54.264
Why are you laughing? It's creepy.

16:55.015 --> 16:57.809
I'll take the orichalcum armor and cape.

16:58.185 --> 17:00.896
I have no use for this magic sword,
so you can have it.

17:01.480 --> 17:03.023
Thank you very much.

17:04.483 --> 17:06.401
It's the magic sword, Death Gaze.

17:06.485 --> 17:07.569
Are you sure?

17:07.653 --> 17:09.905
If you accidentally get cut by it,

17:09.988 --> 17:11.698
you'll die instantly.

17:11.990 --> 17:13.408
We'll take it then.

17:13.492 --> 17:15.285
Thank you, Jean.

17:15.786 --> 17:17.704
Does its reaction to the skeletal horse

17:18.288 --> 17:21.917
mean that the idea of companionship
still lingers within the vessel?

17:22.334 --> 17:24.920
Or is it just the remnants
of its resentment?

17:25.420 --> 17:29.800
That's exactly why
it was stronger than other undead.

17:30.592 --> 17:31.885
It was a formidable foe.

17:32.845 --> 17:34.137
Indeed.

17:36.682 --> 17:38.308
Ta-da!

17:42.354 --> 17:45.357
The meat in this lunchbox is so good!

17:45.524 --> 17:48.026
This isn't just fried chicken
made from monster meat.

17:48.360 --> 17:50.028
It's deep-fried monster.

17:50.112 --> 17:51.822
Eat as much as you like.

17:53.657 --> 17:56.201
It really goes well with curry.

17:56.785 --> 17:58.161
Only Jean gets to eat curry?

17:58.245 --> 17:59.621
Why?

17:59.705 --> 18:02.249
Because he kept pestering me for it.

18:02.541 --> 18:04.459
Give me some!

18:06.086 --> 18:08.088
All right, all right. I get it.

18:09.965 --> 18:13.051
Anyway, that was a tough battle.

18:14.210 --> 18:15.510
(Fran, Age: 12, Race: Beastman, Black Cat)
Fran has leveled up three times

18:15.590 --> 18:16.550
(Magic Swordsman, Contracted, Level 25-28)
since we arrived.

18:17.590 --> 18:18.430
(Urushi, Jet-Black Wolf)
Urushi has leveled up

18:18.510 --> 18:20.050
(Magic Beast, Magic Wolf, Level 1 to 6)
five times.

18:21.185 --> 18:22.186
All right.

18:22.603 --> 18:23.604
Teacher.

18:23.687 --> 18:25.814
Can you take out that box?

18:26.732 --> 18:27.649
Sure.

18:32.529 --> 18:34.072
Jean, what's this?

18:34.948 --> 18:37.784
The magic wand, Hades's Blessing.

18:38.619 --> 18:40.537
It seems it can't be appraised.

18:40.913 --> 18:44.208
It's a named item I found in a dungeon.

18:45.459 --> 18:48.378
It's a cursed item
that drains the user's life force,

18:48.837 --> 18:52.090
but the final battle is likely ahead.

18:52.674 --> 18:54.593
The Dungeon Master?

18:55.552 --> 19:00.557
I sent Fry to the tenth floor to find
the location of the core space.

19:01.600 --> 19:02.601
What's wrong?

19:03.393 --> 19:04.853
Fry's presence has vanished.

19:05.187 --> 19:06.480
What do you mean?

19:07.064 --> 19:09.233
Was it found and destroyed by the enemy?

19:10.150 --> 19:11.068
The enemy?

19:12.945 --> 19:14.071
I see.

19:14.154 --> 19:16.365
So you've made it this far,

19:16.448 --> 19:18.158
intruders.

19:18.450 --> 19:19.368
Who's there?

19:19.952 --> 19:21.370
Do you wish to know?

19:21.870 --> 19:24.665
Then I shall save you the trouble.

19:26.834 --> 19:28.001
This feeling...

19:28.877 --> 19:30.212
The mana flow...

19:30.963 --> 19:32.339
It's a teleportation device!

19:39.805 --> 19:43.183
Welcome to the core space of this dungeon.

19:43.559 --> 19:44.852
The core space?

19:46.687 --> 19:49.106
I'm the Dungeon Master.

19:49.606 --> 19:50.732
Enough talk.

19:51.650 --> 19:52.901
Perish!

19:56.822 --> 19:57.823
Jean!

20:03.871 --> 20:04.913
Urushi!

20:06.999 --> 20:08.125
Teacher!

20:18.093 --> 20:18.969
Fran.

20:19.052 --> 20:20.220
Hey, Fran!

20:20.971 --> 20:22.222
Snap out of it.

20:26.518 --> 20:27.936
Teacher?

20:28.312 --> 20:30.689
It's the Fear and Panic skills.

20:30.772 --> 20:32.900
He exploited a weakness in our minds.

20:32.983 --> 20:34.026
Appraisal.

20:35.940 --> 20:37.360
(Lich, Race: Magic Beast, Undead)
A Lich?

20:37.440 --> 20:39.320
(Status: Wraith, Level 23)
The King of the Undead...

20:39.400 --> 20:42.400
(Title: Dungeon Master)
Strong but on par with a Greater Demon.

20:42.490 --> 20:43.990
(Equipment: Tattered Robe)
Wait. Something is wrong.

20:44.661 --> 20:47.206
I sensed a much stronger mana.

20:47.581 --> 20:49.458
Is he using Camouflage Appraisal?

20:50.083 --> 20:51.627
So you noticed.

20:52.044 --> 20:54.463
He's likely too strong for us to defeat.

20:54.546 --> 20:56.632
Fran, take out Feather of Guile.

20:56.715 --> 20:58.091
We're getting out of here right now.

21:04.806 --> 21:06.266
It's not working.

21:06.892 --> 21:07.893
What?

21:10.145 --> 21:14.691
This space has a mechanism
that blocks teleportation.

21:15.025 --> 21:17.194
Escape is impossible.

21:17.694 --> 21:20.489
No way. What kind of stupid game is this?

21:21.448 --> 21:24.535
Overlord, Undead Summoning.

21:27.204 --> 21:28.288
What?

21:28.660 --> 21:29.620
(Ancient Zombie, Priest
Race: Magic Beast, Undead, Level 24)

21:29.700 --> 21:30.700
(Legendary Skeleton Warrior
Race: Magic Beast, Undead, Level 22)

21:30.790 --> 21:31.620
(Ancient Zombie, High Monk)
Well?

21:31.700 --> 21:34.210
(Race: Magic Beast, Undead, Level 20)
Are you in utter despair now?

21:34.500 --> 21:35.500
(Legendary Skeleton Dark Knight, Level 23)
He summoned six Undead

21:35.580 --> 21:37.840
(Ancient Zombie, High Gunner, Level 24)
on par with that Skeleton Knight?

21:38.507 --> 21:40.300
There's absolutely no way out.

21:41.260 --> 21:42.219
Teacher.

21:43.053 --> 21:45.472
You want to run away.

21:45.556 --> 21:48.642
That means this enemy is so terrifying
you don't want me to face it.

21:49.768 --> 21:50.644
However,

21:51.186 --> 21:52.938
you and I

21:54.398 --> 21:55.983
are the strongest partners!

21:56.692 --> 21:58.443
You're right.

21:59.111 --> 22:00.779
All right. Let's win this!

23:33.950 --> 23:39.500
(Next Episode:
The King of the Undead Falls into Despair)
